{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475580/extras/IMG_6390.png?t=1742074741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space! The final Frontier...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in Opollo, a simple yet deep little minimalist space shooter, harking back to the old days of popping dimes into an arcade and the first man walking on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 200+ plane combinations to unlock, take to the skies in unique combinations to complete challenges and reach new high scores. Space exploration has never been this frantic, with a host of pesky enemies to combo-chain together, and the Primal Colossus to defeat...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylish Combat -</strong> with simple controls that provide depth through a power mechanism, shoot, dash and regain life in a finely tuned balance to drift and weave through enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Celestial</strong> Tunes - <strong>Voyager</strong> is returning with a whole host of new relaxing tunes to elevate the cosmic aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customisable Space Ship -</strong> Guns, Wings and engines can be unlocked and swapped out for over 200+ unique combinations. find the one that suits you to reach new high scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you will join us in playing Opollo, and as the first man walked on the moon, so you too will go down in galactic history as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you have fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With Kind regards,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planetary Gears</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475580/extras/IMG_6389.png?t=1742074741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3475580?t=1742074741","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475580/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742074741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475580/1e70a2831a93ee2d180481feae1ba2bebc118c6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742074741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475580/1e70a2831a93ee2d180481feae1ba2bebc118c6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742074741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475580/extras/IMG_6390.png?t=1742074741\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space! The final Frontier...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join us in Opollo, a simple yet deep little minimalist space shooter, harking back to the old days of popping dimes into an arcade and the first man walking on the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 200+ plane combinations to unlock, take to the skies in unique combinations to complete challenges and reach new high scores. Space exploration has never been this frantic, with a host of pesky enemies to combo-chain together, and the Primal Colossus to defeat...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Stylish Combat -</strong> with simple controls that provide depth through a power mechanism, shoot, dash and regain life in a finely tuned balance to drift and weave through enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragr